    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Traditional 1930s Cottage on Approx. 16 Acres with Commonage Shares – Muingerroon, Barnatra, Co. Mayo"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "The property is located approximately 15 minutes from Belmullet town, with Barnatra and surrounding villages and amenities also within easy reach. The spectacular coastline, beaches, lakes and countryside of Erris are all close by.\r\n\r\nViewing is highly recommended to appreciate the setting, views, landholding and overall potential of this unique property"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Set back from the public road, the property enjoys a private and peaceful setting, with generous parking surrounding the house and stunning uninterrupted views across Carramore Lake and the surrounding countryside.\r\n\r\nThe cottage retains much of its traditional character while offering comfortable accommodation, comprising a living room with open fireplace, small kitchen, bathroom and three bedrooms. The property benefits from oil-fired central heating and double glazing throughout.\r\n\r\nA particular feature of this property is the substantial landholding. The sale includes approximately 16 acres adjoining the cottage, providing considerable scope for agricultural use, grazing or other appropriate rural pursuits. Also included are two shares in the commonage at Muingerroon South, extending to approximately 58 acres, together with 31 Farm Entitlements.\r\n\r\nProperties offering this combination of a traditional cottage, extensive acreage, commonage interests and agricultural entitlements are rarely brought to the market and represent an excellent opportunity for those seeking a rural holding with genuine agricultural potential."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER:"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Viewing Details",
        "SortOrder": 6,
        "Content": "contact for viewing anytime"
      }
    ],
